{
  "uid": "cvm-proxy-cases",
  "title": "CVM 请求案例",
  "description": "有界全量采集、分类展示；此页不是总体统计。",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "cvm",
    "observability"
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "返回代理统计",
      "url": "/d/cvm-proxy",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "service",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "cvm-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, service)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "全部",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "environment",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "cvm-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{service=~\"$service\"}, environment)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "全部",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "instance",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "cvm-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "全部",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "endpoint",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "endpoint",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "cvm-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(cvm_request_response_duration_seconds_count{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",instance=~\"$instance\"}, endpoint)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "全部 endpoint",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "选中 TraceID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "案例选择与完整性",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "正常容量内全量轻量采集，界面每类最多 **3 条**，默认手动刷新。正常候选为随机 TraceID 哈希 **1/16** 标记；慢响应 ≥30s，高本地等待 ≥250ms。类别可以重叠，列表不是总体发生率。\n\n保留 **24 小时**；超过该范围请缩短窗口。只展示已结束的响应；仍运行、进程退出、容量丢弃或导出失败会缺少案例。`lower_bound` 表示开放等待的下界，`detail_truncated` 表示细节达到上限，`export_completeness=unknown` 不保证历史完整。落盘可能晚到；按 TraceID 展开并核对 persistence/shared batch 关联。点击 TraceID 显示原生瀑布图。\n\n列表 Duration 为完整 trace 的跨度，可能包含晚到落盘；响应时间请查看 response root 的 duration 或 `cvm.response_ms`。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "正常随机候选",
      "description": "同一 UTC 窗口和筛选，最多三条已留存案例；无记录可能是未结束、未匹配、过期或丢失。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "cvm-tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "cvm-tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"${service:regex}\" && resource.deployment.environment.name =~ \"${environment:regex}\" && resource.service.instance.id =~ \"${instance:regex}\" && span.cvm.endpoint =~ \"${endpoint:regex}\" && span.cvm.record = \"response\" && span.cvm.normal_candidate = true }",
          "limit": 3,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "无可用案例"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "traceID|Trace ID|TraceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "展开此请求瀑布图",
                    "url": "/d/cvm-proxy-cases?from=${__from}&to=${__to}&timezone=utc&${service:queryparam}&${environment:queryparam}&${instance:queryparam}&${endpoint:queryparam}&var-trace_id=${__value.raw}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
